# ...but the PACKAGED reference tables under spice/objects/ are source, not data: the loaders
# read them from the installed package (see data_loaders._read_object_tsv), so a table that is
# silently untracked works locally and breaks on a fresh install. The hg19 ones were already
# force-added; this makes that explicit and covers the per-assembly tables added since.
!spice/objects/*.tsv
